{'symbol': 'CBOE', 'date': '2021-06-14 11:18:00', 'title': 'CBOE GLOBAL MARKETS ANNOUNCES NEW COMMUNITY ENGAGEMENT PROGRAM, CBOE EMPOWERS', 'text': "CHICAGO, JUNE 14, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CBOE GLOBAL MARKETS, INC. (CBOE: CBOE), A MARKET OPERATOR AND GLOBAL TRADING SOLUTIONS PROVIDER, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE CREATION OF CBOE EMPOWERS, A COMMUNITY ENGAGEMENT PROGRAM THAT PROVIDES MENTORSHIP, SCHOLARSHIP AND GUIDANCE TO UNDER-RESOURCED STUDENTS THROUGHOUT THEIR EDUCATIONAL JOURNEY THROUGH ACCESS TO CBOE'S ASSOCIATES, RESOURCES, WORK ENVIRONMENT AND OTHER LEARNING AND EXPERIENCE OPPORTUNITIES. THE PROGRAM HAS INITIALLY LAUNCHED IN CHICAGO, WITH PLANS TO EXPAND TO OTHER CBOE OFFICE LOCATIONS AROUND THE GLOBE."}